{
  "id": "ru-f6065bfed9a3.en",
  "jokeId": "ru-f6065bfed9a3",
  "locale": "en",
  "title": "The Russian Hell",
  "location": "nebesa",
  "place": "hell",
  "cast": [
    "chort",
    "muzhik",
    "inostranets"
  ],
  "roles": {
    "chort": "devil",
    "muzhik": "everyman",
    "inostranets": "foreigner"
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l1",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "After they died, a Russian and an American ended up in hell. The devil asks them:",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "character": "chort",
      "text": "Which hell will you go to, the Russian one or the American one?",
      "emotion": "smug",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "What's the difference?",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l4",
      "character": "chort",
      "text": "In the American one you have to eat a bucket of crap every day, and in the Russian one, two.",
      "uncensored": "In the American one you have to eat a bucket of shit every day, and in the Russian one, two.",
      "emotion": "smug",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.4,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l5",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "The American chose the American one, and the Russian thought:",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l6",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "I've lived my whole life in Russia, why change now?",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.4,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l7",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "A month later they meet. The Russian asks:",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l8",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "So how is it over there?",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l9",
      "character": "inostranets",
      "text": "Wonderful. I eat a bucket of crap in the morning and I'm free all day.",
      "uncensored": "Wonderful. I eat a bucket of shit in the morning and I'm free all day.",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l10",
      "character": "inostranets",
      "text": "And how about you?",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.6,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l11",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "Same as always: either they didn't deliver the crap, or there aren't enough buckets to go around.",
      "uncensored": "Same as always: either they didn't deliver the shit, or there aren't enough buckets to go around.",
      "emotion": "smug",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.8,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": [],
      "laugh": "big"
    }
  ],
